  "summary": "Checkout – Guest Sign-In Block (Email Input & Send Code Button)",
  "description": "As a Shopper, I want to enter my email address and request a one-time sign-in code at checkout, so that I can authenticate without needing a password.\n\nThis component appears on the checkout entry page for unauthenticated users (Image 1), above the delivery address section. It comprises two elements: an email address text input field and a \"Send Code\" CTA button below it. It does not include social sign-in buttons (see SFCC-346 for Apple and Google sign-in). The component is hidden once the user is authenticated. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-001, CFD-007, CFD-013. Cross-epic dependency: My Account authentication epic.",
