      "id": "18671",
      "key": "SFCC-337",
      "summary": "Checkout – Address Autocomplete Suggestions Dropdown (Google Places API)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see address suggestions appear as I type in the address field, so that I can select my address quickly and accurately without typing the full address manually.\nThis component appears as a dropdown beneath the address autocomplete text input on any delivery or billing address form (Image 7). It is powered by the Google Places API (see SFCC-64) and renders a list of address suggestions based on the partial text entered. Each suggestion is shown as a full address string. An \"Enter Address Manually\" text link appears as the final row in the dropdown list, providing a fallback for addresses not returned by the API (see SFCC-338). This component is shared across all address form states: guest delivery, logged-in delivery, add new delivery address, and billing address forms. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-023, CFD-030, CFD-031. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-64 (Google Address Autocomplete & Maps API — must be delivered first).",
