      "id": "18667",
      "key": "SFCC-333",
      "summary": "Checkout – Delivery Address Form: Guest",
      "description": "As a\n guest shopper,\n\n\nI want\n to enter my delivery address at checkout,\n\n\nso that\n my order can be shipped to my chosen location.\nThis story covers the delivery address form rendered at the checkout delivery step for unauthenticated (guest) shoppers. It is the default state of the delivery address section — no saved address dropdown is shown as the shopper has no account.\nThis story covers the form rendering, field pre-population, and supporting UI elements for the guest delivery address form.\nAddress autocomplete behaviour is covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-337\n and \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-64\n  \nManual Entry is covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-338\n \nIt does not cover authenticated user states — those are covered in;\nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-334\n \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-335\n \nField-level validation (required fields, character limits, format errors) is covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-675\n and is not repeated here.\nThe following are also explicitly out of scope: newsletter signup Omneo integration (separate story), and hover/focus/active visual states (defined in UI kit).\nThis story applies to domestic storefronts only (AU, US domestic, UK, EU domestic). International storefronts (US international, ME, EU international, HK) are handled by Global-E.",
