    {
      "id": "18666",
      "key": "SFCC-332",
      "summary": "Checkout – Deliver To / Collect in Boutique Tab Toggle",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to toggle between Home Delivery and Collect in Boutique at the delivery step, so that I can choose my preferred fulfilment method.\nThis component appears at the top of the delivery section on the checkout page. It renders as two side-by-side tabs: \"Deliver To\" (selected by default, highlighted) and \"Collect in Boutique\". Selecting a tab switches the content area below to the relevant address form or boutique selector. The tab selection persists if the customer navigates back to this step. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page.\nDesign: is the full page loaded or just section by section?",
