      "key": "SFCC-329",
      "summary": "Checkout – Order Summary Panel (Product Tile: Image, Name, Price, Size, Quantity)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see a summary of each item in my bag throughout checkout, so that I can confirm I am purchasing the correct products before completing my order.\nThis component appears in the right-hand order summary panel on the checkout page (Images 1 and 2). For each line item it renders: product thumbnail image, product name, price, colour/size label, and a quantity stepper (minus / quantity / plus). Below each line item are a \"Remove\" link and a \"Wishlist\" link. The panel is persistent across all checkout steps. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-015, CFD-018. Cross-epic dependency: Cart/Bag epic (SFCC basket data), Wishlist epic.",
