      "id": "18710",
      "key": "SFCC-376",
      "summary": "Payments – Card Payment: Saved Card Dropdown & CVV Re-Entry (Logged-In)",
      "description": "As a registered Shopper with a previously saved card, I want to see my saved card pre-selected at checkout and be able to pay without re-entering all my card details, so that I can complete my purchase faster.\\n\\nThis component appears within the Card Payment expanded form for logged-in users who have one or more saved cards (PAY-017). It renders as a dropdown showing the customer's saved card(s) — displaying card type and last four digits — pre-populated with the most recently used card. The customer must re-enter their CVV before submitting the order (PAY-022). Error states: if CVV is missing or incorrect, an inline error message is displayed without losing order data (PAY-008). Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on PAY-017, PAY-022, PAY-008. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-74 (Adyen Payment Integration), My Account / Customer Account epic (PAY-019, PAY-020 — saved card management sits in My Account).",
