      "id": "18708",
      "key": "SFCC-374",
      "summary": "Payments – Card Payment: Expanded Form (Name, Card Number, Expiry, CVC, Complete Order CTA)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to enter my card details securely at checkout to complete my payment, so that I can purchase my order using a credit or debit card.\\n\\nThis component represents the Card Payment expanded state on the checkout payment step (Images 1 and 7). When selected the row expands to show: Name on card field, Card number field, Expiry field, CVC field, Amex/Visa/Mastercard logos in the row header, a Complete Order full-width black CTA button, and the payment policy disclaimer text below. Card capture is handled via Adyen Drop-In (SFCC-74). Error states: this component must handle all payment failure/declined states gracefully (PAY-008) — displaying clear inline error messaging and allowing the customer to retry or select an alternative payment method without losing order data. The system places no limit on the number of retries within a session (PAY-014). Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on PAY-001, PAY-002, PAY-008, PAY-014. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-74 (Adyen Payment Integration).",
