    {
      "id": "18678",
      "key": "SFCC-344",
      "summary": "Checkout – Payment Method Selector (Card, Apple Pay, Klarna, Google Pay, PayPal, Gift/Credit Note)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to choose from a range of payment methods during checkout, so that I can pay using my preferred option.\nThis component appears in the payment section at the bottom of the checkout page, for both guest and logged-in users (Images 1 and 2). It renders as a list of selectable payment method rows, each with a radio button, label, and brand logo. The methods visible in the designs are: Card Payment (Visa, Mastercard, Amex logos), Apple Pay, Klarna, Google Pay, PayPal, and Gift/Credit Note (Zimmermann-branded). Each row expands on selection to reveal the relevant payment input fields. The section is preceded by a \"Payment\" heading and a privacy notice / terms and conditions link. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-058 (billing address context). Cross-epic dependency: Payment Methods epic (card capture, Klarna, PayPal integrations).",
