      "key": "SFCC-342",
      "summary": "Checkout – Shipping Method Selector Dropdown (Method Name, Estimated Delivery Date, Cost), including Packaging Selector Dropdown (Minimal / Recyclable Options)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to select my preferred shipping method from a list of available options showing estimated delivery dates and costs, so that I can choose how quickly and cost-effectively my order is delivered.\nThis component appears on the checkout page below the address form (Images 1 and 2). It renders as a dropdown selector showing the currently selected shipping method, including: method name (e.g. \"Express\"), estimated delivery date range (powered by Narvar, e.g. \"Estimated Delivery: Thu, 14 May – Fri, 15 May\"), and shipping cost. When expanded it shows all available methods. A disclaimer text below references Processing & Delivery Times and a Client Services link. Available methods are configured per storefront in SFCC Business Manager. For international orders (Image 11) the method is labelled \"International\" with a cost shown. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-049, CFD-050, CFD-051, CFD-053, CFD-055. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-61 (Narvar Estimated Delivery), SFCC-63 (Global-e handoff).",
